{"3973990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kizoku no Kage", "steam_appid": 3973990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973990/extras/4878ffd22f2f24776b0ce2ff723ab2c6.avif?t=1785275227\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973990/extras_big/4878ffd22f2f24776b0ce2ff723ab2c6.avif?t=1785275227 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kizoku no Kage ( Noble Shadows ) is a lovingly crafted stealth action game inspired by the legendary Tenchu series. Embark on a thrilling journey as a skilled shinobi, mastering stealth and deception in feudal Japan. Train in ancient ways, infiltrate enemy strongholds, and uncover hidden secrets in a rich, immersive world of ninja lore. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Faithfulness to the Tenchu Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the classic Tenchu series, Kizoku no Kage ( Noble Shadows ) is a loving tribute to the stealth action genre. Carefully crafted to capture the essence of the originals, the game features challenging stealth gameplay, intense action sequences, and an immersive atmosphere that honors the spirit of the classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973990/extras/028bdca50e0d76662d968e8e3a98f4eb.avif?t=1785275227\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973990/extras_big/028bdca50e0d76662d968e8e3a98f4eb.avif?t=1785275227 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immerse Yourself in Feudal Japan </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Hattori Kōsuke, a formidable shinobi and member of the Kizoku no Kage (Noble Shadows), a secretive clan dedicated to eliminating corruption and restoring justice through the shadows. You'll infiltrate enemy strongholds, gather intelligence, and eliminate threats, using stealth, strategy, and cunning to overcome obstacles and bring balance to a world plagued by tyranny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973990/extras/b60cf71435c10a259172b7eb64731b33.avif?t=1785275227\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973990/extras_big/b60cf71435c10a259172b7eb64731b33.avif?t=1785275227 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kill by Stealth. Die with Honor.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your existence is bound by a singular creed: to eliminate threats in the shadows, and to perish with unwavering resolve. As a shinobi of the Kizoku no Kage, your path is defined by discipline, loyalty, and sacrifice. Failure is not an option. Dishonor is not acceptable. Your honor is the last thing you will hold onto.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973990/extras/4878ffd22f2f24776b0ce2ff723ab2c6.avif?t=1785275227\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973990/extras_big/4878ffd22f2f24776b0ce2ff723ab2c6.avif?t=1785275227 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kizoku no Kage ( Noble Shadows ) is a lovingly crafted stealth action game inspired by the legendary Tenchu series. Embark on a thrilling journey as a skilled shinobi, mastering stealth and deception in feudal Japan. Train in ancient ways, infiltrate enemy strongholds, and uncover hidden secrets in a rich, immersive world of ninja lore. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Faithfulness to the Tenchu Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the classic Tenchu series, Kizoku no Kage ( Noble Shadows ) is a loving tribute to the stealth action genre. Carefully crafted to capture the essence of the originals, the game features challenging stealth gameplay, intense action sequences, and an immersive atmosphere that honors the spirit of the classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973990/extras/028bdca50e0d76662d968e8e3a98f4eb.avif?t=1785275227\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973990/extras_big/028bdca50e0d76662d968e8e3a98f4eb.avif?t=1785275227 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immerse Yourself in Feudal Japan </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Hattori Kōsuke, a formidable shinobi and member of the Kizoku no Kage (Noble Shadows), a secretive clan dedicated to eliminating corruption and restoring justice through the shadows. You'll infiltrate enemy strongholds, gather intelligence, and eliminate threats, using stealth, strategy, and cunning to overcome obstacles and bring balance to a world plagued by tyranny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973990/extras/b60cf71435c10a259172b7eb64731b33.avif?t=1785275227\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973990/extras_big/b60cf71435c10a259172b7eb64731b33.avif?t=1785275227 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kill by Stealth. Die with Honor.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your existence is bound by a singular creed: to eliminate threats in the shadows, and to perish with unwavering resolve.